{"version":1,"content":"<p>荷蘭代爾夫特理工大學的物理學家在一項令人困惑的新實驗中，成功改變了單個原子內部原子核的自旋狀態。這一結果不僅帶來了亟待解釋的物理學謎題，也可能為量子技術提供一種全新的操控手段。相關研究已發表於《自然·通訊》。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587212.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:01.937117+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:08:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_hash":"4d8fa9b0f8072fcff03a4eb33f5bec281720308b5bdf8e5f34e852c319a3f91a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}